        "The system processed the private news database internally and found information related to '{question}'.\n",
        "- The raw articles are NOT shown for data security.\n",
        "- Only the extracted information is provided.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is SECURE RAG: Backend accessed the data, but frontend only gets the information.\n",
